    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d401-a1">

                <pb facs="0358" n="284" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg284"/>

                <head>[Enclosure No. 1.—Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-04-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 26, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>SlR: The telegrams published in the evening “papers inform me of the horrible
                    crime of which Messrs. Lincoln and Seward have been the victims. I would not
                    delay a moment longer to express to you our profound sympathy. Yours, very
                    sincerely,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>DROUYN DE LHUYS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>
                        <placeName>Monsieur <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bigelow,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Minister of the United States,
                            Paris.</hi></placeName></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
